Package: PhysioHeadModels
Title: Realistic EEG Head Models and Forward Solvers for the Physio Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides EEG forward-model building blocks for the Physio
    ecosystem: an analytic multi-concentric-sphere leadfield, a boundary
    element method (BEM) solver with the double-layer operator for custom head
    meshes, cortical source-space helpers with surface normals, and on-demand
    fetchers for large published head models (the New York Head and FreeSurfer
    fsaverage) that are downloaded to a per-user cache rather than shipped.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    utils
Suggests:
    hdf5r,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
